{#
  analyze.j2 — read-only investigation prompt.

  Purpose: instruct an agent to explore code/state and return a structured summary.

  Required template_vars:
    task        - what to analyze (string)

  Optional template_vars:
    tools_hint  - guidance on which tools to favor; omitted by default
    submit_tool_name - name of the submit tool injected by the contract;
                       defaults to the literal "submit" so this template
                       renders standalone in tests. The runtime passes the
                       real submit_<node_id> name.
#}
{{ task }}

Investigate using the tools you have. Read, grep, and trace until you have a confident picture; state assumptions when evidence is thin.
{% if tools_hint is defined %}
Tool guidance: {{ tools_hint }}
{% endif %}
When done, call {{ submit_tool_name | default('submit') }} exactly once with the typed payload. Do not narrate the answer in chat — the {{ submit_tool_name | default('submit') }} call is the answer.
